      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.68,
      "end_seconds": 4.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Right, hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.13,
      "end_seconds": 10.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.16,
      "end_seconds": 19.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "I've been dealing with no symptoms. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.7,
      "end_seconds": 26.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Right, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.45,
      "end_seconds": 35.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. Aspirin. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.73,
      "end_seconds": 40.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.37,
      "end_seconds": 47.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I've had it since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.0,
      "end_seconds": 51.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.71,
      "end_seconds": 61.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "I'd give it a six, out of ten. And, And a new partner, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.45,
      "end_seconds": 67.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Have you had any burning when passing urine, rash or sores?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.8,
      "end_seconds": 73.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "No, no burning when passing urine, rash or sores."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.84,
      "end_seconds": 77.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.31,
      "end_seconds": 83.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.53,
      "end_seconds": 88.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.49,
      "end_seconds": 91.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.29,
      "end_seconds": 96.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.82,
      "end_seconds": 102.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.5,
      "end_seconds": 105.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.19,
      "end_seconds": 116.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "I've got heart disease. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.46,
      "end_seconds": 121.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Yes. Alright, anxiety, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.92,
      "end_seconds": 137.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Right, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.55,
      "end_seconds": 141.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Yes, milk. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.92,
      "end_seconds": 145.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.62,
      "end_seconds": 149.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.13,
      "end_seconds": 152.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.61,
      "end_seconds": 155.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.78,
      "end_seconds": 172.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.38,
      "end_seconds": 174.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.54,
      "end_seconds": 179.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.66,
      "end_seconds": 182.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.66,
      "end_seconds": 197.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "There are no visible sores or discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.69,
      "end_seconds": 205.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.18,
      "end_seconds": 233.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It points towards a routine screen with no symptoms. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.04,
      "end_seconds": 238.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Mm, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.96,
      "end_seconds": 256.83,
      "duration_seconds": 17.87,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a routine screen with no symptoms do well once it's treated properly. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had no symptoms, since last weekend, and no burning when passing urine or rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.31,
      "end_seconds": 259.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.16,
      "end_seconds": 301.98,
      "duration_seconds": 28.82,
      "text": "I think a urine test for chlamydia and gonorrhoea makes sense here, for sexual health screen. I think blood tests for HIV and syphilis makes sense here, for sexual health screen. Use condoms with new partners and we will text the results. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.86,
      "end_seconds": 305.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.05,
      "end_seconds": 314.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Book a review after the results. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.53,
      "end_seconds": 319.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
